<title>SWEDEN: AssiDoman to invest 476 mln SKR in Sweden.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman to invest 476 mln SKR in Sweden.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group AssiDoman AB said on Thursday it will invest 476 million crowns in its Swedish plant Skarblacka and the new Tech centre at its plant in Frovi.</p>
</text>
